   "sourcePage": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "MB",
   "inst": 109,
   "name": "Timeout for Bus Watchdog in s Time until Bus Fail will be detected. If Bus Watchdog = 0 then deactivated If Bus Fail Position (Register No. 109) different from 0, the Bus Fail Position becomes active after the Timeout for Bus Watchdog is expired Recomended timeout value with activated watchdog is 120 s.",
